               <title>HOW SUPPLIED</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>WesNate DHA is supplied as oval, orange colored softgel, imprinted with "317" dispensed in bottles of 30 softgels.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>69367-317-30</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20250709"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section>
               <id root="837331ec-dc42-4fc1-bd40-d458ab15ff2b"/>
               <code code="69719-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="HEALTH CLAIM SECTION"/>
               <title>STORAGE</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Store at controlled room temperature 15° to 30°C (59° to 86°F).</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Protect from light and moisture. Dispense in a tight, light-resistant container.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20250709"/>
            </section>
         </component>
         <component>
            <section>
               <id root="113a8346-5248-4717-a654-8aa2005ef4b5"/>
